  <para style="q2"><char style="w" strong="H4270">and need</char> <char style="w" strong="H376">like a bandit</char>.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1"> <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="H1100">A worthless</char> <char style="w" strong="H120">person</char>, <char style="w" strong="H205">a wicked</char> <char style="w" strong="H376">man</char>,</para>
