  <para style="q2"><char style="w" strong="H3384">and pointing</char> <char style="w" strong="H676">with his fingers</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1"> <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="H8419">With deceit</char> <char style="w" strong="H3820">in his heart</char> <char style="w" strong="H2790">he devises</char> <char style="w" strong="H7451">evil</char>;</para>
